"Book time-based appointments with configurable durations, prices, and "
"availability."
msgstr ""
"Reserva cites basades en temps amb durades, preus i disponibilitat "
"configurables."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1987
msgid ""
"In {pluginName}, a “service” is a specific appointment-type offering your "
"business provides to clients - such as consultations, treatments, or classes "
"- that can be fully customized with its own name, duration, price, capacity, "
"availability, and extras, and booked online with assigned employees."
msgstr ""
"A {pluginName}, un “servei” és una oferta específica de tipus cita que el "
"vostre negoci ofereix als clients - com ara consultes, tractaments o classes "
"- que es pot personalitzar completament amb el seu propi nom, durada, preu, "
"capacitat, disponibilitat i extres, i es pot reservar en línia amb empleats "
"assignats."

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1988
msgid "Create event"
msgstr "Crea un esdeveniment"

#: src/Infrastructure/WP/Translations/LiteBackendStrings.php:1989
